# Command and Observe strings. Keys are relative to Mods.Levy.Observe.
SendToPoint: Send to map point
SendToPointHint: Opens the map. Double-click a point and every Regular marches there, fights what is in reach, then holds the spot.
PickPrompt: Double-click a spot on the map to send your army. Drag to move the map. Esc cancels.
MapSendHint: Double-click to send levies here
MapSent: "{0} levies sent to {1}."
MapUnreachable: "{0} levies could not find a way to that point and stopped as close as they could get."
PlaceSpace: space
PlaceSky: the sky
PlaceSurface: the surface
PlaceUnderground: the underground
PlaceCaverns: the caverns
PlaceUnderworld: the underworld
MapNone: You have no levies to send.
CameraName: Camera {0}
Connected: Connected to {0}.
Watching: Watching {0}.
NoGoPro: No levy of yours carries a GoPro.
Lost: The signal is lost.
CamTitle: Camera view
CamLevies: Levies
CamCameras: Cameras
CamEmpty: No GoPro or camera to watch.
CamHideHud: Hide HUD
CamShowHud: Show HUD
CamHideHint: Hides the interface while watching. Esc or this button brings it back.
CamStop: Stop watching
CamStopHint: Return to your own view.
HudRestore: Esc shows the HUD
MindRefused: That levy cannot be controlled.
MindNone: You have no living levy to control.
HudCamera: CAMERA: {0}  (x{1})
HudGoPro: GOPRO: {0}
HudMind: MIND LINK: {0}
KeysCamera: Left/Right: switch camera   Mouse wheel: zoom   Esc: disconnect
KeysGoPro: Left/Right: switch levy   Esc: stop watching
KeysMind: Move, aim and attack as this levy   Left/Right: switch levy   Esc: release
